  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-cc24eea2-4b70-4706-867e-ce45d880e8ea\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size:12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; position: relative; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\"><div class=\"se-component-content\" style=\"margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px 40px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%;\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-f31d2128-e361-4dce-ab24-2207aa46951f\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a1ba3032-3c9d-4459-a0cf-622b2e25a4ac\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">지난글에 이어서 스마트폰 어플과 아두이노 키트를 활용한 SW동아리 활동을 안내합니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-b277defd-9a09-4a78-a068-7e1fe1464e6e\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f1f03cd4-2ce5-4026-8074-4321b5f2dfac\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-1ac12173-5ac9-4890-8015-b5e15823c68d\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a13afedd-47f7-48eb-9889-4ac2cb36aa28\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">지난주(7.1)에 고1과 고2학생이 첫대면을 하여 동아리활동을 했습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-6f1c50ae-689b-462d-87bf-c32cf1a37085\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3592a711-914a-421a-a209-e5b2035670a2\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">이때 메이크 어플을 활용하여 SW활동을 진행했고, 이 과정에서 1학년 중 뛰어난 학생이 1학년 부장, 차장으로 선발되었습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-75a411e0-85aa-4445-ae1f-43900cd9ce3a\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c8c8eedb-da1b-4dfd-85ec-9c76c7f22b98\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">7.8일 1학년만 등교시, 1학년 부장과 차장이 안내하여 메이크 어플과 아두이노 키트를 활용하여 동아리 활동을 하였습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-99857d69-7d7c-4f5a-bf06-568e6a6d7696\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7f9c2819-d439-449d-8303-f984985646fa\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">(이 과정에서 지도교사인 저의 개입없이 학생 스스로가 활동에 참여했습니다.)</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-099f1699-8563-48d8-8b0f-4223dc4b2014\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a6568e1b-27d2-48be-8800-06b39f207bd1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-523b3f9f-6eca-4f7b-b6f0-7d82e2d264bd\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-39c345a6-b5e0-4aaf-9b0a-e269e1e7b9bf\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">1학년 부장의 경우 중학생때 영재교육원에서 아두이노에 대해 배운경험이 있어서, 동아리원들 교육을 할수 있었습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-92e3244f-6237-402a-a045-3096b53b64a4\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64ebaa2a-15ec-4025-a4de-b93cc3569920\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">대다수의 학생들은 어려움이나 문제없이 적극적으로 참여했고, 이는 지켜보던 교사인 저도 놀라웠던점입니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-995d03bc-39fb-449c-a032-2e41bb07758a\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ffc6a02e-48ad-4b9f-a6ca-68a6d495543e\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">처음 아두이노를 접하는 학생들도 어플상에 있는 아두이노 설명과 회로도를 보고 잘 연결했습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-f170fa22-96ba-43a1-bdcd-8818aaee6873\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ba948330-184e-4086-b398-c8fbef9ce5d6\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-08f98fee-06e2-4a34-95da-9c66c1c266c4\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7c5e38df-b109-4398-874f-856a2a7d0fe8\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">개인적으로는 코로나 19로 인하여 학생 동아리가 제대로 운영이 될까 걱정이 되었습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-6a3ec2dc-85a1-4b6f-ae7d-9c3152ddf157\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f48e35fe-89fc-45b6-9323-73914c9426ac\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">교사가 학습여건만 잘 마련을 해준다면 학생들은 스스로 학습이 가능하다는걸 알게 되었습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-050cbd86-9df5-4f60-8477-5cc4708b1eac\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b5af109a-ce62-4346-8ea0-0547bea04d42\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-24bd4f68-fac6-4141-98bc-ba4523629df7\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b066853f-25ad-4931-9a86-fcdfc44ef8c4\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">1학기 학생 동아리 활동은 이번으로 마무리가 되었습니다. </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-d739333b-777d-40a9-8ddd-1dc0da224084\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64f24272-4bed-4c23-a29c-e041875fdf3c\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">키트 구성이 2년전보다 더 좋아하져서, 보관 및 정리에 편했습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-99b7c789-9af8-46ed-ae59-ac98d4a2c3dc\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b1ec1325-93ed-4dae-be91-da41962f77df\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">개인적으로는 2학기때 다시 사용하기에도 편하게 키트가 잘 정리되고, 가격도 저렴해진거 좋은것 같습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-779c527b-e3e2-4ca7-b972-5184d1acbf5a\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-11472ea1-e0ec-445f-9b20-1f8c2de662b9\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-c0c467e3-0586-4445-bfa9-8677c651b061\" style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-220505af-adfd-4f89-a87b-caa458b7cbf7\" style=\"marg